{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/160133-on-the-mmo","id":160133,"title":"On the MMO","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-06-05T12:15:12-07:00","id":160133,"title":"On the MMO","content":"This might be of interest to some.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.theguardian.com/technology/2014/jun/05/world-of-darkness-the-inside-story-mmo-ccp-white-wolf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/static/sys-images/Guardian/Pix/pictures/2014/6/4/1401886188102/8cce5cb8-38c8-4342-908a-d6ed11f2ae65-1020x612.jpeg?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;quality=85&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;precrop=40:21,offset-x50,offset-y0&amp;overlay-align=bottom%2Cleft&amp;overlay-width=100p&amp;overlay-base64=L2ltZy9zdGF0aWMvb3ZlcmxheXMvdGctYWdlLTIwMTQucG5n&amp;enable=upscale&amp;s=89c42fafb5b0724e37910ea48cf2e01f\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.theguardian.com/technology/2014/jun/05/world-of-darkness-the-inside-story-mmo-ccp-white-wolf\" target=\"_blank\"> World of Darkness - the inside story on the death of a game </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.theguardian.com/technology/2014/jun/05/world-of-darkness-the-inside-story-mmo-ccp-white-wolf\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.theguardian.com/technology/2014/jun/05/world-of-darkness-the-inside-story-mmo-ccp-white-wolf </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> This April, the long-awaited multiplayer game World of Darkness was cancelled. Ian G Williams explores how bad management hubris wasted nearly a decade of work </div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/286-christian-a","name":"Christian A","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"832"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T13:32:13-07:00","id":160211,"title":"","content":"Saddened by a great deal to see such incompetence...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T13:48:35-07:00","id":160222,"title":"","content":"It's things like this that truly, truly make me feel that WoD needs a standalone game. Not an MMO, not a multiplayer experience, but something like <i>VTM: Bloodlines</i> (but with less bugs). Heck, if something could be used to emulate the tabletop experience, like some of the mechanics in RPG Maker can, I would be all freaking for it. I do not, however, feel confident that CCP could get it done \u2014 seeing an indie studio's take on it would be cool, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T14:02:05-07:00","id":160233,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/160133-on-the-mmo?p=160222#post160222\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's things like this that truly, truly make me feel that WoD needs a standalone game. Not an MMO, not a multiplayer experience, but something like <i>VTM: Bloodlines</i> (but with less bugs). Heck, if something could be used to emulate the tabletop experience, like some of the mechanics in RPG Maker can, I would be all freaking for it. I do not, however, feel confident that CCP could get it done \u2014 seeing an indie studio's take on it would be cool, though.</div> </div> </div> </div> God, RPG Maker is so cool. I would love an RPG Maker WoD game!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T14:07:12-07:00","id":160237,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/160133-on-the-mmo?p=160233#post160233\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> God, RPG Maker is so cool. I would love an RPG Maker WoD game!</div> </div> </div> </div>Exactly why I suggested it. There are multiple, multiple ways the old RPG tabletop game can be experienced, and we don't need freaking hi-res graphics and celebrity voices to do it. A medium such as Telltale's choose-your-own/point-and-click hybrid, something like the artistic minimalism of Limbo (which reminds me a heckuva lot of the Abyss or the Underworld), or the hand-drawn sprites of certain &quot;retro&quot; games can all be used to express the WoD world. WoD is one of those things that is more an experience than a shooter or a bloody-gibs fighter \u2014 a solid soundtrack, good writing and excellent voicework, as well mechanics that are not buggy or broken, will be a draw in itself.<br /> <br /> If anyone out there has this sort of dream, please, come forward and let CCP/OP know what you have in mind. We need people like you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T14:08:06-07:00","id":160242,"title":"","content":"I would kill to see <i>Bloodlines</i>-equivalents for, say, Changeling: the Lost or Hunter: the Vigil. Tabletop is a niche hobby no matter how much we love it, and getting fresh blood in the fanbase can only be a good thing. I know so many folks who got into WoD through VTMB.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T14:11:05-07:00","id":160243,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/160133-on-the-mmo?p=160242#post160242\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would kill to see <i>Bloodlines</i>-equivalents for, say, Changeling: the Lost or Hunter: the Vigil. Tabletop is a niche hobby no matter how much we love it, and getting fresh blood in the fanbase can only be a good thing. I know so many folks who got into WoD through VTMB.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm one of those people. I was so enraptured by the world of V:tM that it drove me to research the other games. I'm not a vampire fan, in all honesty, but it's because of those games that I found things like <i>Hunter: the Vigil</i>, which I absolutely love.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T15:01:11-07:00","id":160296,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/160133-on-the-mmo?p=160242#post160242\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would kill to see <i>Bloodlines</i>-equivalents for, say, Changeling: the Lost or Hunter: the Vigil.</div> </div> </div> </div>In an ideal world?<br /> <br /> <u><b>Vampire: the Requiem:</b></u> Just take <i>Bloodlines</i>, tone down the exaggeration of the World of Darkness, and add more branching paths for different faction sympathies.<br /> <u>Werewolf: the Forsaken:</u> I'm not exactly certain. Ideas?<br /> <u>Mage: the Awakening:</u> Hmmm.<br /> <u><b>Promethean: the Created:</b></u> Plagiarize <i>Planescape: Torment</i> as hard as you can while putting it into a modern setting. NPC reactions to dialogue choices grow more hostile if you don't space out your visits.<br /> <u><b>Changeling: the Lost:</b></u> Puzzle/adventure game with surreal shifting environments that render it unclear exactly where you are/what realm of existence you're in/what is real and what isn't at any given time.<br /> <u><b>Hunter: the Vigil:</b></u> Turn-based tactical squad shooter. Think <i>XCOM.</i> Remove the research tree and add teamwork mechanics and evolving maneuvers to replace them.<br /> <u>Geist: the Sin-Eaters:</u> Somebody help me out with this one.<br /> <u><b>Mummy: the Curse:</b></u> Great-game style political-conspiratorial simulation. Cults compete for influence over the world, and the awakening of the Arisen attached to these cults result in monumental shifts that force the player to panic and react. Could alternately plagiarize <i>Torment</i> instead of Promethean, but really, what game wouldn't be good if you made it like <i>Torment?</i><br /> <u>Demon: the Descent:</u> I got nothin'.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T15:25:30-07:00","id":160314,"title":"","content":"Oh God, don't tease me with a Promethean vidya that will never happen. It would work <i>so</i> well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T15:29:32-07:00","id":160315,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/160133-on-the-mmo?p=160296#post160296\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><u>Geist: the Sin-Eaters:</u> Somebody help me out with this one.</div> </div> </div> </div><i>Middle Earth: Shadows of Mordor</i> is looking an awful lot like Geist in Middle Earth. Seriously, you play a ranger who dies and is brought back as a half-wraith hybrid. Obviously it's not what we're talking about here, but if the game turns out to be good, it could certainly be mined for ideas of what could go into an actual Geist game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T15:31:02-07:00","id":160317,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/160133-on-the-mmo?p=160296#post160296\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><u>Demon: the Descent:</u> I got nothin'.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm thinking <i>Deus Ex</i> with just a pinch of <i>DMC</i>. Maybe some <i>Watch Dogs </i>to taste.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <b>Mod Voice is <u><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">RED</span></u>*</b><br /> <i>*All other colors should be read aloud in the voice of Don Knotts</i><b>.</b> <hr /><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/18519-pendragon-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">Hacks and House Rules Hub Thread</a></b><br /> <br /> <b>CofD Hacks By Splat: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13vBLaS5Ua1Ez-cVyK6uFa4ssvYeIIZpoA5GQTXytfcA/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Vampire</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sqltG7X-C_MdEe00PtVOZmki8V_K1M1FpQtLwTvb2jg/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#006400\">Werewolf</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1bpr1EjQ4RfZ5dz-tXmJJ93P2f_l7fUIUwpPLWs9Z-SI/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800080\">Mage</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1vKpSTktCUuUaqxXncG4txQPtvPclzXlFZEEX7tbrTSg/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Mummy</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Spynbcs_VgCDHdooKWXobZNe6C9CMjONeRTlvXIq9fI/edit?usp=drive_web\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Demon</span></a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/148-pendragon","name":"PenDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1657"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T15:43:10-07:00","id":160328,"title":"","content":"Shit, how could I miss this. I love this guy's games (well, the ones he has a big stamp on; from NMH 2 on it's downhill).<br /> <br /> <u><b>Demon: the Descent:</b></u> Change identities and become different people with different specialties. Steal the life force from invisible enemies who could be anywhere and anyone, and use it to fuel bizarre powers. Move impossibly fast. Fade away from notice or existence. Rain blood. Watch calamity result from the actions of agents who are subsumed in a mysterious ruling influence. Find out who you really are \u2014 and realize, to the world's horror, that it is something greater than your once-master could ever imagine.<br /> <br /> Kill the past. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLrekaHLD2rhaFgcohRJrOnPXZ3wshjf6Z\" target=\"_blank\">Jump over the age.</a><br /> <br /> Just... figure out something else to do with the gameplay design. Stealth/cover shooter sounds good.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T17:06:27-07:00","id":160385,"title":"","content":"<i>Werewolf: the Forsaken</i> feels to me like it could be a <i>Dragon Age</i> type of game, with quests, various worlds to explore and engaging dialogue, all wrapped up in a nice little combat/hack-and-slash package. <i>Geist: the Sin Eaters</i> could lend itself well to a sort of RPG/exploration/ghost hunting/Limbo hybrid, where you explore the Underworld and use your powers to take care of things threatening to overwhelm the surface.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T20:48:31-07:00","id":160516,"title":"","content":"Last summer I was actually working on hacking together a WoD-style combat system for RPG Maker VX Ace to be a spiritual successor to V:tM-B. It was going to be based on Princess because that's what I was (and still am) running and because I was wary of straying too closely to trademarked franchises. I should see if I could get some screen shots to put up...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T21:03:00-07:00","id":160541,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MagicSwordsman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/160133-on-the-mmo?p=160516#post160516\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Last summer I was actually working on hacking together a WoD-style combat system for RPG Maker VX Ace to be a spiritual successor to V:tM-B. It was going to be based on Princess because that's what I was (and still am) running and because I was wary of straying too closely to trademarked franchises. I should see if I could get some screen shots to put up...</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Rose Bailey once gave an e-mail address if people wanted to talk to the OP team about licensing for fan-games. If you contact her, she might be able to help you out with that. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-06T09:12:30-07:00","id":160887,"title":"","content":"I'm not surprised. We knew most of this even without them saying anything and what CCP was saying didn't make sense half the time. They were having huge issues with Aporypha and Dust 514, but CCP kept throwing everything they could into them. Dust especially was and projections where that it wouldn't see the return on investment they expected. And now even with Dust's comparative lukewarm reception(on the whole I don't know its reception as far as Eve fans) they are pushing &quot;Legion&quot;. Its like an over indulgent parent that has blinders on about their second son. Maybe it will be a turn around since it is on PC, but many are going to be leery after Dust.<br /> <br /> If Star Citizen lives up to what they are saying and showing then it is going to make them look like chumps(big if, but it is looking good). I doubt it will scratch the main Eve even at that because they are very different games, but one can hope that it especially leaves Dust in the...well, dust. I don't hate them for what happened, but stupidity shouldn't be rewarded.<br /> <br /> As to a single player (n/o)WoD I would likely buy that. I was sad when Bloodlines didn't make it as far as it was looking too. Sadly it was too ambitious trying to use the HL2 engine before it was ready hurt them a great deal. That said I love the game, almost as much as I love Redemption. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/160133-on-the-mmo?p=160541#post160541\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Rose Bailey once gave an e-mail address if people wanted to talk to the OP team about licensing for fan-games. If you contact her, she might be able to help you out with that. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>That would be interesting if they actually did. Though I've never heard them mention actually licensing for an actual fan game. Mods and such have been allowed in the past as long as they followed their ignorable limits rules(which I haven't seen any since the old site). It would be interesting though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forever and always forward.<br /> Don't ask why that came to mind or that I felt the need to post it.<br /> I see the incorporeally challenged.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/787-sorwen","name":"Sorwen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-06T11:28:08-07:00","id":160976,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorwen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/160133-on-the-mmo?p=160887#post160887\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That would be interesting if they actually did. Though I've never heard them mention actually licensing for an actual fan game. Mods and such have been allowed in the past as long as they followed their ignorable limits rules(which I haven't seen any since the old site). It would be interesting though.</div> </div> </div> </div>I've proposed the idea of a fan game on the forums before, and there's a topic somewhere around here with Rose's answer in it. If things could be worked out, I think it could be done, but I sure as heck wouldn't feel comfortable with CCP managing it.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-06T12:33:37-07:00","id":161019,"title":"","content":"For licensed games, the place to ask is <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#68191d0d1b1c0107061b281f00011c0d451f07040e460b0705\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"a3d2d6c6d0d7cacccdd0e3d4cbcad7c68ed4cccfc58dc0ccce\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a>. Not having pitched a computer game to CCP, I don't know what their requirements would be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-06T13:40:15-07:00","id":161046,"title":"","content":"Should I use that to ask about a website that has Exalted pdfs just a little too available for viewing (and saving)?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-06T13:52:59-07:00","id":161056,"title":"","content":"That would be the address to report piracy to, yes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-06T23:40:51-07:00","id":161453,"title":"","content":"Thanks Rose, you're awesome. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Seriously though, if anything, the idea of a single-player game should continue to be discussed and encouraged by the community. It's clear a number of people want it, and the nWoD has as much potential as cWoD does to be adapted into a great game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-07T06:39:56-07:00","id":161625,"title":"","content":"About the CCP issues:<br /> I work in the design business and the old &quot;management/marketing vs design&quot; issue is a constant in about every firm I know.<br /> Last minute changes, cancellations, politically motivated decisions and so on are part of everyday life.<br /> Surely the intensity varies, but I found no firm so far that has NO such issues at all.<br /> <br /> <br /> It\u00b4s bitter when bad decisions cost the jobs of the line workers, though.<br /> <br /> <br /> About the Games:<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Demon</b><br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PenDragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/160133-on-the-mmo?p=160317#post160317\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm thinking <i>Deus Ex</i> with just a pinch of <i>DMC</i>. Maybe some <i>Watch Dogs </i>to taste.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yup exactly my thoughts. Would be awesome...and hard to make (good).<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Geist:Sin Eaters</b><br /> <br /> there is a game coming up called Murdered:Soul Suspect.<br /> <br /> I think that\u00b4s pretty geist-reich. I imagine definitely something in the adventure category.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Vampire Requiem</b><br /> <br /> Just give me Bloodlines minus Bugs with nowadays graphics.<br /> I\u00b4ll be happy. Maybe mix some GTA in it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1261,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1261-doc-lumbago","user":"Doc Lumbago","date":". 06-07-2014, 09:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1261-doc-lumbago","name":"Doc Lumbago","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1261_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-07T07:37:43-07:00","id":161696,"title":"","content":"Here's a question I need some sorting out on: Does CCP fully control the rights to all WoD lines and properties, or does that power remain with House Onyx?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-07T08:31:23-07:00","id":161731,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Flyboy254</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/160133-on-the-mmo?p=161696#post161696\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Here's a question I need some sorting out on: Does CCP fully control the rights to all WoD lines and properties, or does that power remain with House Onyx?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/about/faq/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://theonyxpath.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/OPP-Metal.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/about/faq/\" target=\"_blank\"> Frequently Asked Questions &ndash; Onyx Path Publishing </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/about/faq/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://theonyxpath.com/about/faq/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-07T08:37:37-07:00","id":161753,"title":"","content":"Shit, so much for a third party developer to make a WoD game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-10T22:10:03-07:00","id":165632,"title":"","content":"We shouldn't give up hope yet. I would wait until we get official word that CCP isn't interested in dealing with outside developers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-10T22:24:27-07:00","id":165644,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/160133-on-the-mmo?p=165632#post165632\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We shouldn't give up hope yet. I would wait until we get official word that CCP isn't interested in dealing with outside developers.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's also entirely possible that given they have opted not to make a game, they will sell the rights to WoD and/or Exalted on to other companies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-10T22:40:53-07:00","id":165649,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Odd_Canuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/160133-on-the-mmo?p=165644#post165644\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's also entirely possible that given they have opted not to make a game, they will sell the rights to WoD and/or Exalted on to other companies.</div> </div> </div> </div>If someone else wants to develop a game and CCP thinks it would be quality enough to not tarnish their company image I could reasonably see them allowing it. They would make money from the license without having to dedicate their own staff or provide the resources needed for development.<br /> <br /> Is this a possible or likely reality? No idea, I just want a game like Bloodlines to be made since the first one is really well done. The setting of Masquerade lends itself to a single player game better than an MMO in my opinion since a player base for the latter likely is not large enough to be viable.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3197-david-michael-felt","name":"David Michael Felt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3197_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T00:30:54-07:00","id":165704,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>David Michael Felt</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/160133-on-the-mmo?p=165649#post165649\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If someone else wants to develop a game and CCP thinks it would be quality enough to not tarnish their company image I could reasonably see them allowing it. They would make money from the license without having to dedicate their own staff or provide the resources needed for development.<br /> <br /> Is this a possible or likely reality? No idea, I just want a game like Bloodlines to be made since the first one is really well done. The setting of Masquerade lends itself to a single player game better than an MMO in my opinion since a player base for the latter likely is not large enough to be viable.</div> </div> </div> </div>Bloodlines was great mostly because it followed the same playstyle of Dues Ex. hence these pictures:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://cd1.leviathyn.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/05/poster2152067.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://static.giantbomb.com/uploads/original/3/31169/1872819-deus_ex_every_time_you_mention_it_someone_will_reinstall_it.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <br /> Personally, cWoD has a good story but nWoD lends it's much more easily towards modding and the like. The system is also mostly balanced for crossover play (well, except for Mages..)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T01:32:57-07:00","id":165725,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shock</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/160133-on-the-mmo?p=165704#post165704\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Personally, cWoD has a good story but nWoD lends it's much more easily towards modding and the like. The system is also mostly balanced for crossover play (well, except for Mages..)</div> </div> </div> </div>Which is why we have things like Thaumaturges, Psychics and Gutter Witches, who can be substitute magic backup for those lower-tier games. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> <br /> I'm considering putting up polls in each of the forums on what kind of video game the fandoms for each splat would like to play, and then linking it to a mega-thread in the main WoD forum that would poll which splat people most wanted to see game-i-fied.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T05:06:37-07:00","id":165811,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/160133-on-the-mmo?p=160237#post160237\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Exactly why I suggested it. There are multiple, multiple ways the old RPG tabletop game can be experienced, and we don't need freaking hi-res graphics and celebrity voices to do it. A medium such as Telltale's choose-your-own/point-and-click hybrid, something like the artistic minimalism of Limbo (which reminds me a heckuva lot of the Abyss or the Underworld), or the hand-drawn sprites of certain &quot;retro&quot; games can all be used to express the WoD world. WoD is one of those things that is more an experience than a shooter or a bloody-gibs fighter \u2014 a solid soundtrack, good writing and excellent voicework, as well mechanics that are not buggy or broken, will be a draw in itself.<br /> <br /> If anyone out there has this sort of dream, please, come forward and let CCP/OP know what you have in mind. We need people like you.</div> </div> </div> </div>Agree, and I got lots of ideas,<br /> but as I am a Mr.No-one, I think it'll be hard","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>====================================<br /> &quot;Worst English-language User&quot; 2011-2015, 2017 running for the 2018<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ed6RV6Z.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div></div> </div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/515-ryoga84","name":"Ryoga84","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar515_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T20:14:51-07:00","id":166484,"title":"","content":"Sadly as a programmer I have too often had to deal with the kind of incompetence presented in that article. When managers aren't willing to use simple common sense, everyone suffers. My one hope is that one day Onyx Path will be able to buy the full rights for WoD back from CCP and once again be in full control of the line's destiny.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3065-nist498","name":"Nist498","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3065_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-12T18:31:58-07:00","id":167417,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/160133-on-the-mmo?p=165725#post165725\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm considering putting up polls in each of the forums on what kind of video game the fandoms for each splat would like to play, and then linking it to a mega-thread in the main WoD forum that would poll which splat people most wanted to see game-i-fied.</div> </div> </div> </div>Most of them strike me as being some kind of open-world survival-horror RPG (which is a thing that I want to exist regardless of IP), but each splat offers the potential for unique quirks of theme and gameplay. <b>Hunter </b>has already been mentioned as a kind of urban fantasy X-COM. <b>Changeling </b>could have some extra-trippy puzzle-solving dungeons in the Hedge; <b>Werewolf </b>might have the player controlling a party/pack of characters instead of just one. I think <b>Mage </b>would be difficult to adapt faithfully, unless one makes the mod kit a part of the normal UI.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/233-daydreamer","name":"Daydreamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"193"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-12T20:44:02-07:00","id":167509,"title":"","content":"I was thinking about how a Wraith: The Oblivion game set concurrent with the events of VTM:Bloodlines could be cool... <br /> <br /> -The Ocean House from the other perspective<br /> -Finding out what Nercomantic Hoodoo Pisha was getting up to<br /> -Hollywood Zombies<br /> -The Chinese Theater was supposed to be haunted, right?<br /> -Ginger Swan, Muddy, and various other characters who turned up dead in VTMB showing up for cameo appearances, and fleshing out their stories<br /> -The return of some of the bosses, like the Vampire Slasher<br /> -Plus a storyline of its own...<br /> <br /> Because wraith is less about superpowered characters, it would have to be more puzzle oriented (how can I use my arcanoi to solve this problem?) and less to do with fighting spectres... but you could do that too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1078-froggy711","name":"Froggy711","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1078_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"314"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-13T11:09:06-07:00","id":168106,"title":"","content":"Guys, modding Skyrim for a Dark Ages setting would work wonders in this regard. Attributes, Abilities and everything else could be ported into such an engine. Cities with vampires, hunters, mages and demons, Wilderness with werewolves, faes, Lhiannans and gangrels (for cWod), earthbounds, parallel Shadowlands accessible through certain quests or powers, quests about power within mortal society, supernatural conflicts, etc. Possibilities would be very interesting, while benefiting from a solid modding community for very decent gameplay.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/78-bloodarmor","name":"BloodArmor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar78_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-15T15:47:35-07:00","id":170166,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BloodArmor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/160133-on-the-mmo?p=168106#post168106\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Guys, modding Skyrim for a Dark Ages setting would work wonders in this regard. Attributes, Abilities and everything else could be ported into such an engine. Cities with vampires, hunters, mages and demons, Wilderness with werewolves, faes, Lhiannans and gangrels (for cWod), earthbounds, parallel Shadowlands accessible through certain quests or powers, quests about power within mortal society, supernatural conflicts, etc. Possibilities would be very interesting, while benefiting from a solid modding community for very decent gameplay.</div> </div> </div> </div>I apologize for the caps in the next sentence.<br /> <br /> <i><b>THIS NEEDS TO BE A THING.</b></i><br /> <br /> Seriously, if anyone can come up with something like this, I'd love to see it. Additionally, wouldn't <i>Amnesia: the Dark Descent </i>work as well with its level creator?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-15T15:53:12-07:00","id":170169,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/160133-on-the-mmo?p=170166#post170166\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I apologize for the caps in the next sentence.<br /> <br /> <i><b>THIS NEEDS TO BE A THING.</b></i><br /> <br /> Seriously, if anyone can come up with something like this, I'd love to see it. Additionally, wouldn't <i>Amnesia: the Dark Descent </i>work as well with its level creator?</div> </div> </div> </div>Amnesia could probably work well for a mortals game, but you'd have to do some pretty heavy modding if you wanted to play as a supernatural character.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-07T09:25:13-07:00","id":506925,"title":"","content":"I'm starting to believe that a massive multiplayer wod game wouldn't work. I think the WoD setting implies a relative small monsters population. So, unless it has a lot of mortal NPCs in a huge map or unless players rather go mortal instead of supernatural, it would break the mood of the setting I guess.<br /> <br /> Probably a 'just multiplayer' game would work better. I'd like to see a 'friendly-fire allowed' co-operative multiplayer online rpg (without the first M in MMORPG): The concept for me is cooperation and fun but pvp should be allowed too, of course. I like 1st/3st person rpgs because they get me better immersed - I want to play a character not to be a pupeteer of a group of chars (at least for this game). And multiplayer because single-player games lack the warmth of companionship. But, as it was similarly stated above, the important thing is to have an engaging product which puts into practice the wod concepts, setting and operating rules no matter the media. It just needs to be simple but expandable, I think. If only CCP would grant rights to a small group of skillful artists.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2738-onirim","name":"Onirim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2738_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-07T14:17:29-07:00","id":507210,"title":"","content":"World of Warcraft subs are down to 7 million. They were at 10 million last year. A record amount unsubscribed in the first quarter this year. Honestly, I'm in agreement that a WOD MMO wouldn't have worked.<br /> <br /> I'd much, MUCH rather have a new single player World of Darkness game.<br /> <br /> I'm still pissed we never got a Werewolf the Apocalypse game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-07T19:03:26-07:00","id":507478,"title":"","content":"I would far rather have a new single player game, but admittedly I am biased as I don't care for MMO style games. I like my RPG stories to be about my character being The One, not the one like all the others.<br /> <br /> <br /> That having been said, there was potential IMO in the idea of a large scale bickering and backstabbing and player driven economy/environment kind of thing akin to what was apparently done with EVE.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-07T19:20:27-07:00","id":507494,"title":"","content":"I think multiplayer is the big sell now. I could see some sort of arena type game, similar to <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nosgoth\" target=\"_blank\">Nosgoth</a>. MOBAs seem to have taken the money-making crown from MMOs, though EVE is still doing well, not many are.<br /> <br /> EVE had a nice economy system, but what do you do with vampire? A blood based economy is hard to really fit or make worthwhile.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-07T19:25:25-07:00","id":507497,"title":"","content":"I'd love to see a game similar to the first <i>Guild Wars</i>, where the world was instanced for your character alone, but there were also areas where players gathered. You could also team up and go into instanced areas as a group as well as go on quests together. Something like that, to me, would have been far more feasible than a full-on MMO, and it would have held true to the feel of the WoD - your character and her coterie/pack/cabal going out and experiencing the story while being able to return to areas where vampires, werewolves, and/or mages have gathered.<br /> <br /> Just my opinion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/457-arcanus-dicere","name":"Arcanus Dicere","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar457_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"353"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-07T19:28:41-07:00","id":507499,"title":"","content":"Yeah, Guild Wars managed the storytelling aspect of things pretty well, something other MMOs have had a hard time with or not bothered to do. They even had a metaplot going with their expansions.<br /> <br /> I prefer MUDs for online gaming, but graphics are where the money is. Outside of a few standout exceptions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-07T22:52:46-07:00","id":507721,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/160133-on-the-mmo?p=507494#post507494\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think multiplayer is the big sell now. I could see some sort of arena type game, similar to <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nosgoth\" target=\"_blank\">Nosgoth</a>. MOBAs seem to have taken the money-making crown from MMOs, though EVE is still doing well, not many are.<br /> <br /> EVE had a nice economy system, but what do you do with vampire? A blood based economy is hard to really fit or make worthwhile.</div> </div> </div> </div>Making Vampire the MMO about blood is rather like making EVE about wheat and other cargo. It's a thing, and you a niche that you could probably develop, but by and large the blood is just fuel for the rest of the game.<br /> <br /> Politics, influence, convincing people to make more clubs and keeping them profitable, thus providing feeding grounds, dealing with other vampires and other supernaturals.... that would need to be the meat and potatoes of a vampire game. You would need the ability to lead a mercenary strike force to deal with the occasional physical threats, run companies and shell organizations, political influence and power gathering and trading. It would need to be a world sim, and your goal is to get as much of it as you can.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}